        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="gh-meta" style="margin-top: 0.6rem; font-size: 0.95rem;">
        Visit <a href="https://github.com/Zulfan15" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/Zulfan15 ↗</a> for real-time commits and repositories.
